{"title":"Bog Pelt","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Bogling, Bog, Elder Bog, Ancient Bog, Mire Bog +1 more</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ancient-bog\" title=\"Ancient Bog - dropped it in 6 of 8 looted corpses (1/1.3)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/d9577e9ca753524743d6.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ancient Bog</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.3<br>×1–2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"elder-bog\" title=\"Elder Bog - dropped it in 17 of 23 looted corpses (1/1.4)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/1fc398c9d042e4ee3267.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Elder Bog</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.4<br>×1–4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"bog\" title=\"Bog - dropped it in 399 of 572 looted corpses (1/1.4)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/fe582e27e9d83b3d3f96.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bog</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.4<br>×1–4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"bogling\" title=\"Bogling - dropped it in 805 of 1,171 looted corpses (1/1.5)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/40fefc5bf6085eae0053.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bogling</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.5<br>×1–6</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+2 more\">+2 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"mire-bog\" title=\"Mire Bog - dropped it in 5 of 9 looted corpses (1/1.8)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/06615ce670ebc6746d4e.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mire Bog</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.8<br>×1–2</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"bombardier-beetle\" title=\"Bombardier Beetle - dropped it in 1 of 4 looted corpses (1/4)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/4c7c78c99318ec394ebe.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bombardier Beetle</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×4</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"bog-pelt\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/851eda3e442f3ed8925d.svg\" alt=\"Bog Pelt\"></div><h3>Bog Pelt</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>6 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/8/2026, 10:32:08 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}